=== layout: one-panel

# Learning objectives

@body

- Connect microbial metabolism with environmental applications.
- Compare fuel production, biosensing, and synthetic biology.
- Explain genetic engineering in plants and animals.
- Evaluate the evidence behind biotechnology claims.

=== layout: one-panel

# A few useful words

@body

- [*Community*]{underline=true}: the organisms sharing a habitat.
- [*Consortium*]{underline=true}: organisms working together in a process.
- [*Remediation*]{underline=true}: reducing contamination or its harmful effects.
- [*Synthetic biology*]{underline=true}: designing and testing biological parts or systems.

